Run 2: Velero restored

From 2026-10-18T23:16:30Z to 2026-10-18T23:17:03Z, 'kubectl -n styrmin scale deploy/velero --replicas=1' and 'kubectl -n styrmin rollout status deploy/velero' brought Velero back to 1/1. The run started right after.
When the Velero server started, it processed the two Backup objects left by run 1, from 23:16:47Z to 23:17:11Z: one ended Completed and the other PartiallyFailed, with 1 of its 4 backup hooks failed. The cause of the hook failure was not investigated. Run 1's environment backup was not used again, and this did not affect run 2.

